===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|such}}, {{m|enm|swuch}}, {{m|enm|swich}}, {{m|enm|swilch}}, {{m|enm|swulch}}, from {{inh|en|ang|swelċ}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*swalīk}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*swalīkaz|t=so formed, so like}}, equivalent to so + like. Cognate with {{cog|sco|swilk}}, {{m|sco|sic}}, {{m|sco|sik|t=such}}, {{cog|stq|suk|t=such}}, {{cog|fy|suk}}, {{m|fy|sok|t=such}}, {{cog|nds|sülk}}, {{m|nds|sulk}}, {{m|nds|suk|t=such}}, {{cog|nl|zulk|t=such}}, {{cog|de|solch|t=such}}, {{cog|da|slig|t=like that, such}}, {{cog|sv|slik|t=such}}, {{cog|is|slíkur|t=such}}. More at {{m|en|so}}, {{m|en|like}}.

